<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A+ to Mitsubishi Estate straight bonds.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A+ to Mitsubishi Estate straight bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Wednesday it had assigned A+ ratings to Mitsubishi Estate Co Ltd's three ten billion yen domestic straight bonds.</p>
<p>The bonds are due to mature on June 25, 2004, 2009, and 2012, and carry a coupon rate of 2.550 percent, 3.075 and 3.275 respectively.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the outlook for the rating was negative.</p>
</text>
